# Response headers for the deployed assets. Vite copies public/ into dist/, where
# Cloudflare parses this file — it is never served. See docs/DEPLOY.md.
#
# The default for every asset is `public, max-age=0, must-revalidate`, which is
# already right for files whose name stays put while their contents change. Only
# the fingerprinted ones are overridden below.
#
# Never add Cache-Control to /* — it would pin index.html and sw.js, stalling the
# autoUpdate service worker for the whole max-age.

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/workbox-*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=()
